d 'XTQQR': module to perform panel quantile-on-quantile regression and panel QQKRLS
d
d  xtqqr implements the quantile-on-quantile (QQ) regression of Sim
d and Zhou (2015, Journal of Banking and Finance,
d doi:10.1016/j.jbankfin.2015.01.013) for panel data:
d kernel-weighted local-linear quantile regressions over a grid of
d quantiles of the outcome and of the regressor, with Canay (2011)
d or dummy fixed effects, pooled or unit-specific quantiles, a
d quantile-group variant, clustered Powell sandwich or panel
d block-bootstrap standard errors, and a validation against panel
d quantile regression. xtqqkrls implements the quantile-on-quantile
d KRLS of Adebayo, Ozkan and Eweade (2024, Journal of Cleaner
d Production, doi:10.1016/j.jclepro.2024.140832) for panels.
d xtqqplot draws tile heatmaps (MATLAB Parula colour map) with
d significance stars, contour maps, slices and validation plots. 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: quantile regression
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f xtqqr.ado
f xtqqr.sthlp
f xtqqkrls.ado
f xtqqkrls.sthlp
f xtqqplot.ado
f xtqqplot.sthlp
f xtqqr_example.do
f xtqqr_methods.sthlp
f ../_/_xtqqr_load.ado
f ../_/_xtqqr_savelong.ado
f ../l/lxtqqr.ado
